From c1a2a175ce335ff6ae46c8651206832667350b76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SacredTrees <121399723+SacredTrees@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 06:30:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] JavaScriptCore: a structure+name cache for the 68k
 interpreter's property loads

get_by_id sites that have seen more than one shape, get_by_id that finds
nothing, and get_by_val with a string or symbol key look up VM's
MegamorphicCache before walking the prototype chain, and fill it under the
same rules as the JITs' megamorphic get_by_id. JSC_useM68KMegamorphicCache=0
turns it off.

Team 3
---
